<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill Lynch cuts Fluor.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill Lynch cuts Fluor.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it downgraded Fluor Corp to near-term neutral from accumulate, keeping it as a long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 1-1/2 to 63-3/8 after falling 13 on Wednesday after it reported disappointing first quarter earnings.</p>
